@startuml
!include _theme.puml
title Vapor Product-Stack Proof Overview
caption Phase 3 proves Vapor platform seams; USF, worldmodel, rendering, save/load, and gameplay stay outside this proof.
top to bottom direction

package "Authoring and Distribution Plane" as Authoring <<plane>> {
  rectangle "SDK Authoring Surface" as SDK <<surface>>
  rectangle "Capability Declaration Material\nVapor.toml + Rhai Assets" as Declarations <<capability>>
  rectangle "Kernel Artifacts" as Kernels <<native>>
  rectangle "Distributable Artifacts" as Artifacts <<artifact>>
  rectangle "Steam Workshop / Installed Index" as Workshop <<external>>
}

package "Composition and Lock Plane" as Composition <<plane>> {
  rectangle "Launcher / SDK Validation" as Validation <<surface>>
  rectangle "Packagepack Selection\nEnginepack + Gamepack + Modpacks" as Selection <<pack>>
  rectangle "Capability Graph Staging" as Graph <<capability>>
  rectangle "Vapor.lock + Fingerprints" as Lockfile <<artifact>>
  rectangle "Runtime Lock" as RuntimeLock <<lock>>
}

package "Launch Runtime Plane" as Runtime <<plane>> {
  rectangle "Engine/Game Fixtures\ncore_engine + core_mod + base_mod" as Fixtures <<runtime>>
  rectangle "Capability Runtime + Runtime Substrate" as RuntimeCore <<runtime>>
  rectangle "Diagnostics + Logs" as Diagnostics <<diagnostic>>
}

rectangle "Phase 3 Scope Boundary\nVapor proof only" as Boundary <<boundary>>

SDK --> Declarations : classifies authored material in
SDK --> Kernels : builds native backing into
Declarations --> Artifacts : contributes graph source to
Kernels --> Artifacts : package native backing as
Artifacts --> Workshop : move through
Workshop --> Validation : supplies installed candidates to

Validation --> Selection : resolves user choices into
Selection --> Graph : contributes selected pack material to
Graph --> Lockfile : emits resolved identity into
Lockfile --> RuntimeLock : prove compatibility for
Graph --> RuntimeLock : passes deep validation into
Boundary --> Validation : constrains acceptance for

RuntimeLock --> Fixtures : admits launch of
Fixtures --> RuntimeCore : run locked graph through
RuntimeCore --> Diagnostics : reports outcomes to
@enduml
